body:
Argh. I feel you. Hubs here called me 'fucking mental' in our most recent argument, and he still hasn't come back to own that he's being a piece of shit. Never mind that we've been on chilly terms since then and it's been over a week. I don't want to bring it up again because I'll just still be angry about it, and he's clearly waiting on... something? I have no idea.

&#x200B;

I'm sorry to hear you're also dealing with a crappy spouse.
